## 5. Suggested Remediation
Bind all entity queries strictly to the caller tenant identifier extracted from the cryptographically verified session token.

```typescript
// ✅ Secure Controller (Strict Tenancy Binding):
app.get('/api/v1/resource', authenticateToken, async (req, res) => {
  const resource = await db.findOne({
    id: req.params.id,
    organization_id: req.user.organization_id // Enforces caller ownership
  });
  if (!resource) {
    return res.status(404).json({ error: 'Resource not found or unauthorized' });
  }
  return res.json(resource);
});
```
